elt under your armpits and tighten it.\n8. safe descent: Hold onto the wall with your hands and descend safely without lifting your arms.\n9. successful escape: You have safely escaped and overcome the fire situation.", "short_description": "Understand the critical use of life lines in rescue operations. This experiment teaches the proper techniques for descending from heights safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9055194621179199"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974901_1759387867820800_2151389964957558194_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yVKnvmAtroEQ7kNvwFJXPEd&_nc_oc=AdnlCDAJ3uR8YIB_Yr3gnPSq5tU4I5o7DkLBkpN1j8m58_LQBnkpQ4R54bo7H3HjDKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfshMmwZHHtn1WtL45gybGS622gFSRD5CLkMS6BanhILgA&oe=69A96A50"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "The Use Of Descending Life Line- ContentsDa", "pla